+## Other hosts (Switch port M08, 2026-11-19)
+
+- A host without a keyboard, a mouse or a desktop window hides their rows (`settings::setHidden`): the values are
+  still loaded, saved and reset, and a page left with no row has no tab (`settings::pages`).
+- A host with its own way to the menus turns the desktop's gamepad chords off (`ui::setDesktopGamepadChords`: Back +
+  Start, Back + RB, Back + LB; on the Switch Back is the game's Select, and the port's developer menu opens on
+  L3 + R3). Its menu draws first in the UI hook (`vcs::launcher::setHostUi`) and blocks the game's input as these do;
+  `ui::openTrainerMenu` / `closeTrainerMenu` open the trainer from it.
+- vcs.ini values must be whole decimal integers: `atoi` took `abc` or `1x` as a valid 0 or 1, so a damaged file
+  switched toggles without a word; such a value is now ignored with the `[settings] ... ignoring` line, and the next
+  save writes the key's real value over it.
+
